# Build context exclusions. Keep this tight - the context is the repo root so
# that pnpm workspace files are available to both images.

**/node_modules
**/.next
**/dist
**/.turbo
**/coverage
**/reports
**/test-results
**/playwright-report

.git
.github
.husky
.vscode
.cursor
.claude

# Never ship secrets into an image layer
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example

# Docs and scripts that no image needs
docs
archive
tests
lib
*.md
!README.md
install.sh
profolio.sh

**/.DS_Store
**/*.log
**/.certificates
